THIRD-PARTY DATA

  The chart in this repository contains information from the following datasets,
  accessed on 2 October 2026 from data.gov.sg (https://data.gov.sg/) and made
  available under the Singapore Open Data Licence
  (https://data.gov.sg/open-data-licence):

  Urban Redevelopment Authority: Private Residential Property Price Index (Base
  Quarter 2009-Q1 = 100), Quarterly.
  https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_97f8a2e995022d311c6c68cfda6d034c/view

  Urban Redevelopment Authority: Private Residential Property Rental Index ,
  (Base Quarter 2009-Q1 = 100), Quarterly. The chart shows the non-landed,
  whole-island series.
  https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_8e4c50283fb7052a391dfb746a05c853/view

  Housing & Development Board: HDB Resale Price Index (1Q2009 = 100), Quarterly.
  https://data.gov.sg/datasets/d_14f63e595975691e7c24a27ae4c07c79/view

  sgmacro also uses data from SingStat Table Builder
  (https://tablebuilder.singstat.gov.sg/), to which SingStat's Terms of Use
  apply (https://www.singstat.gov.sg/terms-of-use).

  The original publishers include the Urban Redevelopment Authority, Housing &
  Development Board, Monetary Authority of Singapore, Ministry of Manpower and
  Singapore Department of Statistics.

  The displayed data is a saved example rather than a current feed. Processed
  figures, tables, calculations and commentary are produced by this project and
  should not be attributed to the data publishers. No government agency endorses
  this project.

  Housing-policy information is manually maintained from official policy
  announcements. Those announcements remain subject to their publishers' terms.

